        "name": "Phao - 2 Phut Hon (KAIZ Remix, Nightcore) [Chroma]",
        "description": "Has Chroma lights. Please install Chroma and enable all effects for the beautiful Chroma 2.5.0+ lightshow.\n\nWell, well, a bit outdated TikTok moment. However, I love this Nightcore version of the song.\nAlso, Kaleidoscope 🙂\n\nFull spread, as per usual. Do not shy away even if you are a new player, you will find the difficulty suitable for you.\nExpert+ is techy. Beware 😀\n\nLightshow preview: https://youtu.be/t--TUUclKKQ\nGameplay preview: https://youtu.be/HlP4AOr5HKg\n\nAdditional thanks:\nHuge thanks to @Timbo for the RT mod and @thewilddash for the student RT mod. \nPublic mods: @Alice, @ThySpoon\nPlaytesting: @Artjoms, @ThySpoon, Alternate, Nymph, Approxima, and many, many others\nTech mapping advice: @a-jhintleman <3\n\nEnjoy the map. And enjoy the lights.\n\nKeep up to date with my maps: https://twitter.com/fatalution\nWould love to hear your feedback: Fatalution#3973",
