        "id": "342b1",
        "name": "Lou Bega - Mambo No. 5",
        "description": "Yo\nIncluding extra lawless difficulties which remove the crouch walls for the people that can't or don't want to crouch\n\nHave fun!\n\n► Gameplay:  https://youtu.be/zBljDgwil6o\n\n► Map Details:\n▪ Difficulties: Expert, Hard, Normal & Easy\n▪ Duration: 3:40\n▪ BPM: 174\n\n----------------------------------------------\nExpert:\n▪ Note Jump Speed: 18\n▪ Spawn Offset: -0.15\n▪ Total NPS:  5.57\n▪ Total Notes:  1174\n----------------------------------------------\nHard:\n▪ Note Jump Speed: 15\n▪ Spawn Offset: -0.1\n▪ Total NPS: 4.64\n▪ Total Notes: 978\n----------------------------------------------\nNormal:\n▪ Note Jump Speed:  14\n▪ Spawn Offset: 0.22\n▪ Total NPS:  2.56\n▪ Total Notes: 541\n----------------------------------------------\nEasy:\n▪ Note Jump Speed: 12\n▪ Spawn Offset: -0.1\n▪ Total NPS:  2\n▪ Total Notes: 435\n----------------------------------------------\n\nSong:\n Artist/Producer: Lou Bega \n Title: Mambo No. 5\n Link:  https://music.youtube.com/watch?v=RUBvqz3ozv8\n\n► Socials:\nhttps://zanesaber.carrd.co/\n\n►⎸ ABOUT COPYRIGHT ⎸◄ \n~ Credits goes to the artist from their original song, i do not own the song in this map  and I do not make any money from it.\n~ If any producer or record label has an issue with my upload please send me an e-mail and i will take it down:\nE-Mail: zanesaber@duck.com\n\nCheers",
