        "name": "Scare Me (feat. Karra) - LUM!X, KSHMR & Gabry Ponte [Chroma]",
        "description": "Has Chroma lights. Please install Chroma and enable all effects for the beautiful Chroma 2.4.9+ lightshow.\nRequested by Stemisty.\n\nGo and dance to this jammer and don't be scared of backhand sliders! They are fun, I promise.\nFull spread, as per usual. Do not shy away even if you are a new player, you will find the difficulty suitable for you.\n\nLightshow preview: https://youtu.be/sJCnn7eSevw\nGameplay preview: https://youtu.be/hIg47juUE5E\n\nAdditional thanks:\nHuge thanks to @SlimyBlob for the RT mod! \nPlaytesting: @Jabob, @Reddek, @Alice, @Artjoms, Nymph, Dietah, Stemisty.\n\nEnjoy the map. And enjoy the lights.\n\nKeep up to date with my maps: https://twitter.com/fatalution\nWould love to hear your feedback: Fatalution#3973",
