        "name": "舞音KAGURA - Sayonara. Arigatou. / さようなら。ありがとう。",
        "description": "**Note: Requires BS >=1.18.0**.\n\n2nd track from Sign, doujin album by 舞音KAGURA.\n\nIllust: Pudding\nhttps://www.pixiv.net/en/artworks/89240480\n\nPreview:\nhttps://youtu.be/WIb0kD-owRo\n\n2nd map for ranked. Lily Billie.\n\nHuge thanks for @Timbo , @Anii , and @Alice for modding the map! Also thanks to @namaki_mono and @TheCzar1994 for playtesting.\n\nAny feedback welcome on Discord: XAce1337manX#9170\n\nReup 1: Haha missing event data\nReup 2: Timing fixes\nReup 3: Timing fixes again",
