        "id": "41d71",
        "name": "Chime & MDK - Arcade Dwellers",
        "description": "here it is - more than two years later, the spiritual successor to my Space Invaders map!\n\ni have to say, this is my favorite map that i've made thus far. also my first five diff map, but i've only made three of the diffs myself. one day i'll make a proper fullspread... maybe. this is the longest i've taken to make one map in a very good while too.\n\ncollab with @DirtyAlex! man just never disappoints, he made two banger diffs.\nbig thanks to @BanditByTheStreet for lighting the first half of the map, i took it from there. \nalso thanks to playtesters!: @Undeceiver, @EerieWolf, @TheBlackParrot, @DancePunkDragon\n\nAvexus Ex+ Preview: https://youtu.be/5yLleFFVztw\nDirtyAlex Ex+ Preview: https://youtu.be/WZdbFMzrJR4\n\nExpert, Normal - Avexus\nHard - DirtyAlex\n\nhope ya like! :3",
