        "id": "41258",
        "name": "[OTG Pack] One True God & EDDIE - Not Enough",
        "description": "One True God Pack - We Are All God\n\nThe way you say my name without a doubt\nI swear it's not enough\nThe way you feel me up and down\nRight there, I swear it's not enough\n\nFeatures mapping by Spinvvy, as well as a full custom environment by Nugget.\nWorks on any noodle/chroma supported version 1.29+ (NOT QUEST)\n\nPreview (Courtesy of TheCzar1994): https://youtu.be/wvL6Q2ow5U8\n\nExpert+: @Spinvvy\nExpert: @Spinvvy\nHard: @Spinvvy\n\nhttps://beatsaver.com/playlists/712566\nFeedback is appreciated, \nSpecial thanks to all the playtesters.\n\nMuch love,\nNugget",
