        "name": "I'll Be Your Home - Afinity & Lizzy Land",
        "description": "hi, i suppose i'm back with probably my most ambitious lightshow yet.\r\nOver 16 hours were spent on the project, and just a little under 12 hours were spent on the lightshow ALONE\r\nJust want to thank everyone who has helped me and supported whatever the fuck i do nowadays, and so i bring you this map.\r\n\r\nBefore i even promote my own preview i want to thank Remie and Hypersonicsharkz' map of Falling Away (MiTiS Remix) for being a very very big inspiration to this project, and for being a very big inspiration on my lighting style alone.\r\nYou can find that map right here - https://beatsaver.com/maps/19b8c\r\nYou can find Remie's beatsaver here - https://beatsaver.com/profile/4285346\r\nYou can find Hypersonicsharkz's beatsaver here - https://beatsaver.com/profile/4284788\r\n\r\nYou can watch the preview of my map right here - https://youtu.be/UBHMDoLDR-w",
