        "name": "Tatsunoshin & No Hero - All Or Nothing",
        "description": "Another Milkie map!!\r\n\r\nThis is probably one of the maps I'm the most proud of. This is also the first time I'm making a custom lightshow!\r\nThank you Tonkie for collaborating with me on this <3\r\n\r\nMiljon's Flicks (Expert+) - This is on the faster side with some 340 bpm flicks and dancey walls.\r\nTonkie's Tech (Expert) - This is somewhat fast and has a lot of horizontal tech gameplay.\r\nTonkie's Standard (Hard) - Standard accuracy. Yea B)\r\nMiljon's True (Normal) - True accuracy. Yea2\r\n\r\nLightshow - Yea it's a lightshow (shocking)\r\n\r\nEnjoy!",
