        "name": "Rhymes of Vales (Genshin Impact - Sumeru Battle Theme)",
        "description": "This is my favorite Sumeru battle theme!\nI was really excited going into mapping this hope you all enjoy!\nits very techy :] beware\nLawless has 225 degree palm ups in the end hehe\n\nThank you so much to everyone who play tested! almost everyone that could test on twitch and discord did and i'm so very grateful to all of you! <3\nThis was a very high effort map that took about 6 weeks lol\nI think i'll take a small break from mapping because this was really tiring :]\n\nOriginal song: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EXaKoH2zZSQ\nMap Preview: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rt1WYs8G02I\n\nSend me feedback here: https://www.twitch.tv/cush_is_me\nor discord: cush_is_me\nor write a feedback in the reviews so I may improve on my future maps!",
